<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>英特尔注册确认 - 开发员专区高级帐户</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<style type ="text/css"> 
	
	
	/* IE8 COMPENSATE FOR HTML5 COMPATIBILITY */
	article, aside, figure, caption, figcaption, footer, header, main, nav, section, summary {
	display: block;
	}

	
	/* STRUCTURE */
	body {
	-webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
	background-color:#f9f9f9;
	background: url('https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png') repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;
	height: 100%;      
	outline: medium none;
	}
	
	#container { /* "Container" contains all the layout code, sets page width in (pixels), and easily centers page. */
	width: 600px;  /* Good width of the vast majority of computer screens - 960px is standard because most users have 1024×768 resolution or higher */
	margin-top: 10px; /* Outside the container line */ 
	margin-right: auto; /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */
	margin-bottom: 10px;
	margin-left: auto;  /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */
	position: relative;  /* "relative" because using things called floats */  /* position options {"relative", "absolute"} */
	background-color: #FFFFFF;
	border-color: #E5E5E5;
	border-style: solid;
	padding: 25px 50px 0px 50px; /*top right bottom left  -- Inside the container line */ 
	border-width: 1px;
	overflow: hidden;   
	line-height: 1.5em;
	}
	
	
	hr {
	background-color: #E5E5E5;
	color:#E5E5E5;
	border: 0 none;
	height: 1px;
	}	


	img.floating {  /* image with text around it */ 
	float: right;
	padding: 4px 0px 0px 50px;  /** top right bottom left **/ 
	}


	/* TEXT STYLES */
	body {
	font-family: "Intel Clear", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; 
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: 10pt;
	color: #666666;
	}
	
	header {
	font-family: "Intel Clear Pro", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;
	font-weight: normal;
	font-size: 1.1em;
	color: #003C71;
	line-height: 2em;
	}
	
	section  {
	font-size: 0.8em;	
	font-style: italic;
	color: black;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	
	footer  {
	font-size: 0.9em;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	
	footer a {
	text-decoration: none;
	}
	
	a {
	color: #086DB6;
	}
	
	.intelBlueTextStyle {
	color: #086DB6;
	}
	
	.subjectTextStyle {
	font-size: 1.2em;
	font-weight: bold;
	color: #086DB6;
	line-height: 1.4em;
	}
	</style>
</head>


<body>
<div id="container"><header>
<h1><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/5104bda0-0fc2-11ec-901e-3750230d5760.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" width="700" height="156" /></h1>
<hr /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><!-- horizontal line --></span></header><main>
<p class="subjectTextStyle"><span>待批准</span></p>
<p><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">欢迎 {!Contact.Name},</span></p>
<p><span>感谢您注册开发员专区高级帐户。</span></p>
<p><span>如果您尚未与英特尔签署企业保密协议 (CNDA)，则可能需要最多 10 个工作日来审核您的高级帐户申请。您将在 3 个工作日内看到状态更新。</span></p>
<p><span>在审核您的高级帐户申请时，您可以立即以标准用户的身份访问英特尔的开发员专区。</span></p>
<p><span></span><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><b>用户名：</b> <span class="intelBlueTextStyle">{!Contact.Core_Login_Id__c}</span></span><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><b>电子邮件地址：</b><span class="intelBlueTextStyle">{!Contact.Email}</span></span></p>
</main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">请保留这封电子邮件供以后参考。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">您的密码应该像机密一样受到保护。您对密码和英特尔网站的使用受英特尔使用条款的约束，每个相关站点的网页底部均有使用条款的链接。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">如果您有任何疑问，请<a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/cn/zh/forms/support/my-intel-sign-on-support.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">联系我们</a>。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">若需管理您的个人资料，包括可用的营销订阅信息，请访问“<a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/cn/zh/secure/my-intel/profile.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">我的英特尔</a>”。</span></p>
<main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">请勿回复此邮件。这是一封自动回复邮件。为了确保能继续收到我们的邮件，请将我们添加至您的地址簿。</span></p>
</main>
<section>
<p style="text-align: right;"></p>
</section>
<hr /><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><img class="floating" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png" alt="英特尔标记" height="42" width="64" />英特尔致力于保护您的隐私。如欲了解更多信息，请参阅<a href="http://www.intel.cn/content/www/cn/zh/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html">英特尔隐私条款</a>。<a href="http://www.intel.cn/content/www/cn/zh/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html">英特尔 Cookie 声明</a>。</span><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><a href="http://www.intel.cn/content/www/cn/zh/legal/terms-of-use.html">法律信息</a> | <a href="http://www.intel.cn/content/www/cn/zh/legal/trademarks.html">商标</a> | <span style="font-size: 1em;">©</span> 英特尔公司。</span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">!%TemplateCode%!</span><br /><br /></footer></div>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></p>
</body>
</html>